.TH "storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline" "6" "2026-11-19" "Storage Room User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline - the command to run Storage Room.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline [\f[I]GTK options\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Storage Room is a 2k executable graphics released by Suricrasia Online
in June 2020, ranked 3rd in the 4k procedural graphics competition at
NOVA 2020.
.PP
blackle [code, gfx]
.PP
The demo opens fullscreen and renders, line by line, a single 1920x1080
image with a GLSL path tracer.
The time spent on the rendering is printed on the standard output when
it is finished.
.PP
The screen must be at least 1920 pixels wide, otherwise nothing is
rendered.
On a larger screen, the image is drawn in the bottom left corner.
OpenGL 4.3 is required.
.PP
Press Escape to quit.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
The demo only accepts the standard GTK options (see
\f[B]gtk-options\f[R](7)), for example \f[B]--display\f[R].
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\f[B]SAMPLES\f[R]=\f[I]number\f[R]
Number of samples per pixel.
A higher number gives a cleaner image but takes longer to render.
The default value is 300.
.RS
.PP
Example: \f[B]SAMPLES=50 storageroom-by-suricrasiaonline\f[R]
.RE
